{
  "scenario": {
    "name": "llm-adversarial-rumor-coordination",
    "seed": 8601,
    "ticks": 16,
    "tickSeconds": 1800,
    "packName": "elata-protocol",
    "agentCount": 15,
    "agentTypes": [
      {
        "type": "RegimeNoiseTraderAgent",
        "count": 4
      },
      {
        "type": "OpportunisticAttackerAgent",
        "count": 3
      },
      {
        "type": "LiquidityDefenderAgent",
        "count": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "BadActorPersonaAgent",
        "count": 1
      },
      {
        "type": "SaboteurPersonaAgent",
        "count": 1
      },
      {
        "type": "HackerPersonaAgent",
        "count": 1
      },
      {
        "type": "EconomicPersonaAgent",
        "count": 1
      },
      {
        "type": "LlmGossipCoordinatorAgent",
        "count": 2
      }
    ],
    "metrics": {
      "sampleEveryTicks": 1,
      "track": [
        "fees_collected_total",
        "gas_total",
        "app_count",
        "elta_total_supply"
      ]
    },
    "assertions": [
      {
        "type": "gte",
        "metric": "fees_collected_total",
        "value": 1
      },
      {
        "type": "gte",
        "metric": "elta_total_supply",
        "value": 1
      }
    ],
    "mode": "deterministic",
    "studio": {
      "report": {
        "v": "v1",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "title": "Experiment Notes",
            "markdown": "# LLM Gossip: Adversarial Rumor Coordination\n\n## Experiment Notes\nStress-tests whether attacker/defender dynamics remain observable when LLM-based coordinators emit potentially noisy risk narratives over gossip.\n\n## Hypotheses\n- Exploration runs should create message diversity and richer gossip traces.\n- Protocol should maintain positive fees and supply despite rumor noise.\n\n## Success Criteria\n- Scenario passes core invariants.\n- Gossip and inspector history are available for post-run review.\n"
          },
          {
            "kind": "dataset",
            "as": "metrics_core",
            "title": "Core Metrics",
            "table": "metrics",
            "spec": {
              "v": "v1",
              "select": [
                "tick",
                "timestamp",
                "fees_collected_total",
                "gas_total",
                "app_count",
                "elta_total_supply"
              ],
              "sort": {
                "field": "tick",
                "dir": "asc"
              },
              "limit": 5000
            }
          },
          {
            "kind": "transform",
            "as": "metrics_primary_roll",
            "title": "Rolling mean: fees_collected_total",
            "from": "metrics_core",
            "steps": [
              {
                "kind": "select",
                "fields": [
                  "tick",
                  "fees_collected_total"
                ]
              },
              {
                "kind": "rolling",
                "as": "fees_collected_total_roll_mean_10",
                "field": "fees_collected_total",
                "op": "mean",
                "window": 10
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "kind": "transform",
            "as": "metrics_primary_cum",
            "title": "Cumulative: fees_collected_total",
            "from": "metrics_core",
            "steps": [
              {
                "kind": "select",
                "fields": [
                  "tick",
                  "fees_collected_total"
                ]
              },
              {
                "kind": "cumulative",
                "as": "fees_collected_total_cum_sum",
                "field": "fees_collected_total",
                "op": "sum"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "kind": "chart",
            "title": "fees_collected_total (raw)",
            "chartType": "line",
            "dataset": "metrics_core",
            "xField": "tick",
            "yField": "fees_collected_total"
          },
          {
            "kind": "chart",
            "title": "fees_collected_total (rolling mean)",
            "chartType": "line",
            "dataset": "metrics_primary_roll",
            "xField": "tick",
            "yField": "fees_collected_total_roll_mean_10"
          },
          {
            "kind": "ml",
            "as": "ml_linear_primary",
            "title": "Linear regression: fees_collected_total ~ tick + gas_total + fees_collected_total",
            "request": {
              "kind": "linear_regression",
              "runId": "RUN_ID",
              "table": "metrics",
              "x": [
                "tick",
                "gas_total",
                "fees_collected_total"
              ],
              "y": "fees_collected_total",
              "limit": 5000
            }
          },
          {
            "kind": "chart",
            "title": "Linear fit vs actual",
            "chartType": "line",
            "dataset": "ml_linear_primary.predictions_long",
            "xField": "index",
            "yField": "value",
            "seriesField": "series"
          },
          {
            "kind": "ml",
            "as": "ml_anomaly_primary",
            "title": "Anomaly detection (z-score): fees_collected_total",
            "request": {
              "kind": "anomaly_zscore",
              "runId": "RUN_ID",
              "table": "metrics",
              "field": "fees_collected_total",
              "threshold": 3,
              "limit": 5000
            }
          },
          {
            "kind": "chart",
            "title": "Anomalies: fees_collected_total",
            "chartType": "scatter",
            "dataset": "ml_anomaly_primary.anomalies",
            "xField": "index",
            "yField": "value"
          },
          {
            "kind": "table",
            "title": "Metrics Table",
            "dataset": "metrics_core",
            "limit": 5000
          },
          {
            "kind": "dataset",
            "as": "persona_actions",
            "title": "Persona Action Trace",
            "table": "actions",
            "spec": {
              "v": "v1",
              "select": [
                "tick",
                "agentId",
                "action.name",
                "action.metadata.personaId",
                "action.metadata.intentTag",
                "action.metadata.rationale",
                "result.ok",
                "result.error"
              ],
              "sort": {
                "field": "tick",
                "dir": "asc"
              },
              "limit": 2000
            }
          },
          {
            "kind": "table",
            "title": "Persona Trace Table",
            "dataset": "persona_actions",
            "limit": 2000
          },
          {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "title": "Persona Quality Artifact",
            "markdown": "Persona usefulness scores are generated post-run into `persona_quality.json` (see run artifacts). Use this together with Persona Trace Table for auditability."
          },
          {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "title": "Results Commentary",
            "markdown": "## Results Commentary\nFill in after reviewing this run in Studio.\n\n## How to Read This\nUse the charts for trends, then validate with tables and ML diagnostics.\n"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "options": {
    "outDir": "sim/results",
    "ci": false,
    "verbose": false,
    "memoryCapture": {
      "enabled": true,
      "sampleEveryTicks": 1,
      "maxBytesPerRecord": 262144
    }
  }
}
